JtUKCIvx9mWaurt357FaSELjbEK09TKvjiwfKo14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsvFXWn4MJdADgzrZNPV01bl9DSx1iFSofO9KmkBU72Cw&oe=699DB02B"}, {"file_name": "ingame5.png", "id": "2005053430059779", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_2005053433393112_6190407981189298886_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O3Wbqjy70VYQ7kNvwEGJj8K&_nc_oc=AdkwvcNsjTjmH0py4CCEtAAa2tYwVMqVa9W2eQ9alIZLwH3OzAwSvENY6QfPGZu1FLo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvIhik-UAKzS5GBfPVazOxiHnPR3BRwG-Hv9LWIXmEqyA&oe=699DACFB"}, {"file_name": "ingame1.png", "id": "794333413474747", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618440_794333416808080_5724071060507227845_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gUQmBoltBHoQ7kNvwGCZNd5&_nc_oc=Adnf9pnrYCYUNXChbG8KPHsGD2eSIXpzH52MJMrIEgfB34fs1nBtQlKFloCw3_s5XUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvdM0xjVPvXuPzk5VY_wR4ta5902hUMwivGgyzRnKW5ww&oe=699D8B87"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "maincover1_revised.png", "id": "4182678325319122", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623370_4182678328652455_8097312879023856265_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FamyHwssoZAQ7kNvwFO16F_&_nc_oc=AdnVwpewCTeLjBOF6L3JRPbPHt4oNjbt8s8-tQNSiPs3n4jDRu6tBaVth3G6B7FoIpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvhkDA06sjFJzD3GzemGuc9A9fapwO7EpdKukRdNeekCA&oe=699D8A1D"}, "display_name": "ParameterRoom", "keywords": ["MixedReality", "VirtualReality", "SocialPlatform", "RoomSharing", "MakingFriend"], "long_description": "\n\n# ParameterRoom: XR Social Platform Based on Real Space\n\nParameterRoom is built on **BerryHi\u2019s 'Real-Space Fusion Technology,'** offering a new social experience that clearly differentiates it from existing VR platforms.\n\n{1160966002805324}\n---\n\n## \u2728 Key Features\n\n### 1. Virtualization of Real Space\n* **Automatic Room Creation:** Scans your actual room and instantly converts it into a virtual room. Experience a vivid sense of presence, as if others are right there in your space.\n\n### 2. Connecting Space-to-Space\n* **Organic Arrangement:** Multiple user rooms are arranged and combined to create a single XR social space.\n* **Novel Social Experience:** The **'Connection of Rooms'** itself acts as the unit of interaction, allowing seamless connection across physical barriers.\n\n### 3. Sharing and Expression\n* **Share Room Photos:** Snap and share photos of your actual room with other users to exchange glimpses of daily life.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Why ParameterRoom?\n* **Differentiation:** Provides both reality-based connection and immersive presence simultaneously.\n* **Market Leader:** Poised to lead the next-generation XR social market during the early adoption of high-performance MR HMDs.\n\n### \ud83d\udce2 Coming Soon!\nLook forward to more engaging social experiences! Easily **customize your room with diverse assets** to show off your personality, and use **private room creation and search** features to meet **more privately** with friends.\n\n**\ud83d\udc49 Transform your room into the new Social Universe today!**\n", "short_description": "Beyond VR: Your actual space becomes the new social universe. The next-generation XR community platform, powered by BerryHi\u2019s innovative \u2018Real-Space Fusion Technology.\u2019"}]}, "developer_name": "BerryHi Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.berryhi.com/group/parameter-room-announcements/discussion/f2981197-a492-41c0-8c25-b0bdb179d754", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BerryHi Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.berryhi.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1228796255027646"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED",